{
  "slug": "css_text_shadow",
  "course": "css",
  "order": 44,
  "url": "/css/css_text_shadow.asp",
  "title": "CSS Text Shadow",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "CSS Text Shadow"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "CSS Text Shadow"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The text-shadow property adds shadow to text."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "In its simplest use, you only specify the horizontal and the vertical shadow."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "In addition, you can add a shadow color and blur effect."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Text shadow effect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": "h1\n{\n\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px;\n\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_text-shadow1"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Next, add a color (red) to the shadow:"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Text shadow effect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": "h1\n{\n\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px red;\n\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_text-shadow2"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Then, add a blur effect (5px) to the shadow:"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Text shadow effect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": "h1\n{\n\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px red;\n\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_text-shadow3"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "More Text Shadow Examples"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Text shadow effect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": "h1 {\n\n  color: white;\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000000;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_text-shadow4"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Text shadow effect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": "h1 {\n\n  text-shadow: 0 0 3px #ff0000;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_text-shadow5"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Multiple Shadows"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The text-shadow property\nalso accepts multiple shadows for an element. Define each shadow in a\ncomma-separated list."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The following example shows a red and blue neon glow shadow:"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Text shadow effect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": "h1 {\n\n  text-shadow: 0 0 3px #ff0000, 0 0 5px #0000ff;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_text-shadow6"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The following example shows a white text with black, blue, and red neon glow:"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Text shadow effect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": "h1 {\n\n  color: white;\n  text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px black, 0 0 25px blue, 0\n  0 5px red;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_text-shadow7"
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "variant": "note",
      "text": "Go to our CSS Fonts chapter to learn about how to change fonts, text size and the style of a text.\nTip: Go to our CSS Text Effects chapter to learn about different text effects."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "The CSS Text Shadow Property"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": ["Property", "Description"],
      "rows": [["text-shadow", "Specifies the shadow effect added to text"]]
    }
  ]
}
